INSERT INTO `films` (`id`, `title`, `episode_id`, `opening_crawl`, `director`, `producer`, `release_date`, `image_url`, `short_description`, `long_description`, `created`, `edited`)
VALUES
	(1,'A New Hope','4','It is a period of civil war.\r\nRebel spaceships, striking\r\nfrom a hidden base, have won\r\ntheir first victory against\r\nthe evil Galactic Empire.\r\n\r\nDuring the battle, Rebel\r\nspies managed to steal secret\r\nplans to the Empire\'s\r\nultimate weapon, the DEATH\r\nSTAR, an armored space\r\nstation with enough power\r\nto destroy an entire planet.\r\n\r\nPursued by the Empire\'s\r\nsinister agents, Princess\r\nLeia races home aboard her\r\nstarship, custodian of the\r\nstolen plans that can save her\r\npeople and restore\r\nfreedom to the galaxy....','George Lucas','Gary Kurtz, Rick McCallum','1977-05-25','https://www.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1280/6FfCtAuVAW8XJjZ7eWeLibRLWTw.jpg','A New Hope introduced the galaxy to the struggle between the Empire and the Rebel Alliance. Luke Skywalker embarks on his heroic journey after discovering Princess Leia\'s plea for help. Guided by Obi-Wan Kenobi, he begins to learn the ways of the Force. Their mission leads to the destruction of the Death Star. This film represents discovery, rebellion, and the spark of hope.','Released in 1977, \'A New Hope\' is the film that launched the Star Wars saga. Set in a galaxy under Imperial tyranny, it follows young Luke Skywalker, a farm boy from Tatooine, who stumbles upon a message from Princess Leia hidden in a droid named R2-D2. Teaming up with Obi-Wan Kenobi, Han Solo, Chewbacca, and Leia, Luke begins a journey that reveals his destiny as a Jedi. Obi-Wan introduces him to the Force and the history of the Jedi Order. The group faces danger aboard the Death Star, a massive space station capable of destroying entire planets. Obi-Wan sacrifices himself to allow the others to escape. The Rebels analyze plans hidden in R2-D2 to find a weakness in the Death Star. Luke volunteers to join the Rebel assault. With guidance from the Force and the memory of Obi-Wan, he fires the crucial shot that destroys the station. The film ends with a celebration of victory and hints at greater adventures to come. \'A New Hope\' laid the foundation for the Star Wars universe. Its themes of heroism, destiny, and resistance against oppression continue to resonate. The story of an unlikely hero rising against evil captured imaginations worldwide. The Force becomes a central mystery. The birth of rebellion and the rise of hope make this film iconic.','2014-12-10T14:23:31.880000Z','2014-12-20T19:49:45.256000Z'),
	(2,'The Empire Strikes Back','5','It is a dark time for the\r\nRebellion. Although the Death\r\nStar has been destroyed,\r\nImperial troops have driven the\r\nRebel forces from their hidden\r\nbase and pursued them across\r\nthe galaxy.\r\n\r\nEvading the dreaded Imperial\r\nStarfleet, a group of freedom\r\nfighters led by Luke Skywalker\r\nhas established a new secret\r\nbase on the remote ice world\r\nof Hoth.\r\n\r\nThe evil lord Darth Vader,\r\nobsessed with finding young\r\nSkywalker, has dispatched\r\nthousands of remote probes into\r\nthe far reaches of space....','Irvin Kershner','Gary Kurtz, Rick McCallum','1980-05-17','https://www.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1280/nNAeTmF4CtdSgMDplXTDPOpYzsX.jpg','The Empire Strikes Back deepens the Star Wars saga with darker tones. The Empire hunts the Rebels, striking Echo Base on Hoth. Luke seeks Jedi training with Yoda on Dagobah. Han and Leia flee into betrayal and capture. Darth Vader reveals a shattering truth to Luke. The film embodies struggle, loss, and revelation.','\'The Empire Strikes Back\', released in 1980, is the second film in the original trilogy and considered one of the greatest sequels ever made. The story opens with the Rebel Alliance stationed on the icy planet Hoth. After an Imperial attack, the Rebels scatter. Luke Skywalker travels to Dagobah, where he trains with Jedi Master Yoda and learns the difficult path of the Jedi. Meanwhile, Han Solo, Leia, Chewbacca, and C-3PO are pursued by the Empire and eventually take refuge on Cloud City. There, they are betrayed by Lando Calrissian and captured by Darth Vader. Vader tortures Han and uses Leia and the others as bait to lure Luke. In a climactic duel, Luke confronts Vader and learns the shocking truth: Darth Vader is his father. Luke escapes but is left injured and emotionally shaken. Han is frozen in carbonite and taken by Boba Fett. The film ends on a somber note, with the heroes regrouping and vowing to rescue Han. \'The Empire Strikes Back\' explores deeper themes of identity, failure, and resilience. It portrays the cost of rebellion and the burden of legacy. The darker tone adds gravity and maturity to the saga. It stands as a cornerstone in Luke’s journey and the battle between light and dark. The film’s revelations forever changed the Star Wars mythos.','2014-12-12T11:26:24.656000Z','2014-12-15T13:07:53.386000Z'),
	(3,'Return of the Jedi','6','Luke Skywalker has returned to\r\nhis home planet of Tatooine in\r\nan attempt to rescue his\r\nfriend Han Solo from the\r\nclutches of the vile gangster\r\nJabba the Hutt.\r\n\r\nLittle does Luke know that the\r\nGALACTIC EMPIRE has secretly\r\nbegun construction on a new\r\narmored space station even\r\nmore powerful than the first\r\ndreaded Death Star.\r\n\r\nWhen completed, this ultimate\r\nweapon will spell certain doom\r\nfor the small band of rebels\r\nstruggling to restore freedom\r\nto the galaxy...','Richard Marquand','Howard G. Kazanjian, George Lucas, Rick McCallum','1983-05-25','https://www.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1280/jQYlydvHm3kUix1f8prMucrplhm.jpg','Return of the Jedi concludes the original trilogy with redemption and triumph. Luke confronts Vader and the Emperor. The Rebels battle the Empire over Endor. Han and Leia lead a daring ground assault. Ewoks aid the fight against tyranny. Anakin is redeemed through his son’s compassion. The film represents victory, forgiveness, and balance.','Released in 1983, \'Return of the Jedi\' is the final installment in the original trilogy. The story begins with the rescue of Han Solo from Jabba the Hutt on Tatooine, led by Luke Skywalker and his allies. Luke, now a confident Jedi, returns to Dagobah to complete his training. Yoda confirms Vader is Luke’s father and reveals that Leia is his twin sister. The Rebel Alliance prepares for a final assault on the second Death Star, under construction above the forest moon of Endor. Han, Leia, Chewbacca, and a team lead a ground mission to disable the shield generator protecting the station. They are aided by the native Ewoks, who join the battle against the Imperial troops. Meanwhile, Luke surrenders to Vader in an effort to redeem him. Taken to the Emperor, Luke is tempted by the dark side. In a climactic moment, Vader chooses to save his son and destroys the Emperor, sacrificing himself. Anakin Skywalker is redeemed, and peace is restored. The Death Star is destroyed in a final Rebel attack. The film ends in celebration across the galaxy. \'Return of the Jedi\' explores themes of redemption, destiny, and unity. It brings resolution to key character arcs. The battle between father and son becomes a symbol of the power of compassion. The light triumphs, and a new era begins.','2014-12-18T10:39:33.255000Z','2014-12-20T09:48:37.462000Z'),
	(4,'The Phantom Menace','1','Turmoil has engulfed the\r\nGalactic Republic. The taxation\r\nof trade routes to outlying star\r\nsystems is in dispute.\r\n\r\nHoping to resolve the matter\r\nwith a blockade of deadly\r\nbattleships, the greedy Trade\r\nFederation has stopped all\r\nshipping to the small planet\r\nof Naboo.\r\n\r\nWhile the Congress of the\r\nRepublic endlessly debates\r\nthis alarming chain of events,\r\nthe Supreme Chancellor has\r\nsecretly dispatched two Jedi\r\nKnights, the guardians of\r\npeace and justice in the\r\ngalaxy, to settle the conflict....','George Lucas','Rick McCallum','1999-05-19','https://www.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1280/6wkfovpn7Eq8dYNKaG5PY3q2oq6.jpg','The Phantom Menace begins the saga with political intrigue and hidden evil. Jedi protect Naboo from Trade Federation threats. Young Anakin Skywalker is discovered with great Force potential. Darth Sidious operates in secret. The Sith reemerge through Darth Maul. The film explores beginnings, prophecy, and concealed danger.','\'The Phantom Menace\', released in 1999, is the first episode of the Star Wars saga. It introduces the galaxy in a time of political turmoil. The Trade Federation blockades the peaceful planet Naboo, prompting the Jedi Council to send Jedi Master Qui-Gon Jinn and his Padawan Obi-Wan Kenobi to negotiate. They rescue Queen Amidala and flee to Tatooine, where they encounter Anakin Skywalker, a gifted boy with powerful Force sensitivity. Qui-Gon believes Anakin may be the Chosen One foretold to bring balance to the Force. They also face Darth Maul, a deadly Sith warrior and apprentice to the hidden Darth Sidious. The Republic remains unaware of the Sith’s return. The film builds a backdrop of rising darkness beneath a crumbling democracy. The Jedi face political constraints and their own fading influence. Anakin wins his freedom and joins the Jedi path. The climactic battle sees Darth Maul killed by Obi-Wan, but not before Qui-Gon falls. Chancellor Palpatine rises in political power. The seeds of future conflict are planted. \'The Phantom Menace\' lays the foundation for Anakin’s destiny, the Republic’s decay, and the Sith’s quiet resurgence. Its themes of fate, trust, and illusion begin the tragic arc of the prequel trilogy.','2014-12-19T16:52:55.740000Z','2014-12-20T10:54:07.216000Z'),
	(5,'Attack of the Clones','2','There is unrest in the Galactic\r\nSenate. Several thousand solar\r\nsystems have declared their\r\nintentions to leave the Republic.\r\n\r\nThis separatist movement,\r\nunder the leadership of the\r\nmysterious Count Dooku, has\r\nmade it difficult for the limited\r\nnumber of Jedi Knights to maintain \r\npeace and order in the galaxy.\r\n\r\nSenator Amidala, the former\r\nQueen of Naboo, is returning\r\nto the Galactic Senate to vote\r\non the critical issue of creating\r\nan ARMY OF THE REPUBLIC\r\nto assist the overwhelmed\r\nJedi....','George Lucas','Rick McCallum','2002-05-16','https://www.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1280/oZNPzxqM2s5DyVWab09NTQScDQt.jpg','Attack of the Clones explores love, war, and rising darkness. Anakin and Padmé’s romance deepens. Obi-Wan uncovers a clone army on Kamino. The Republic begins to militarize. Count Dooku leads the Separatist movement. War erupts on Geonosis. The galaxy edges toward civil war and moral decline.','\'Attack of the Clones\', released in 2002, is the second film in the prequel trilogy. Set ten years after \'The Phantom Menace\', the galaxy faces division as systems break away from the Republic. After an assassination attempt on Senator Padmé Amidala, Anakin Skywalker is assigned to protect her. They fall in love despite Jedi restrictions. Obi-Wan Kenobi investigates the attacks and discovers a secret clone army on Kamino, commissioned for the Republic without Senate knowledge. His search leads to Count Dooku, a former Jedi who now leads the Separatists. On Geonosis, Obi-Wan is captured, prompting Anakin and Padmé to attempt a rescue. The Jedi arrive with the new clone army, igniting the first battle of the Clone Wars. Anakin loses his arm in a duel with Dooku. The film ends with war declared and Anakin secretly marrying Padmé. \'Attack of the Clones\' explores themes of secrecy, forbidden love, and political decay. It shows Anakin’s first steps toward the dark side. The Jedi Order is shown as overstretched and out of touch. Palpatine’s influence continues to grow. The galaxy enters a period of deception, conflict, and shifting loyalties. The Clone Wars begin, setting the stage for the Republic’s fall.','2014-12-20T10:57:57.886000Z','2014-12-20T20:18:48.516000Z'),
	(6,'Revenge of the Sith','3','War! The Republic is crumbling\r\nunder attacks by the ruthless\r\nSith Lord, Count Dooku.\r\nThere are heroes on both sides.\r\nEvil is everywhere.\r\n\r\nIn a stunning move, the\r\nfiendish droid leader, General\r\nGrievous, has swept into the\r\nRepublic capital and kidnapped\r\nChancellor Palpatine, leader of\r\nthe Galactic Senate.\r\n\r\nAs the Separatist Droid Army\r\nattempts to flee the besieged\r\ncapital with their valuable\r\nhostage, two Jedi Knights lead a\r\ndesperate mission to rescue the\r\ncaptive Chancellor....','George Lucas','Rick McCallum','2005-05-19','https://www.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1280/xfSAoBEm9MNBjmlNcDYLvLSMlnq.jpg','Revenge of the Sith marks the fall of Anakin Skywalker. War consumes the galaxy. Palpatine manipulates Anakin into joining the dark side. The Jedi Order is destroyed in Order 66. Anakin becomes Darth Vader. The film embodies tragedy, betrayal, and the dawn of the Empire.','\'Revenge of the Sith\', released in 2005, is the final chapter of the prequel trilogy and depicts the tragic transformation of Anakin Skywalker. As the Clone Wars rage on, Anakin becomes close to Chancellor Palpatine, who manipulates him with promises of power and visions of saving Padmé from death. Palpatine reveals himself as Darth Sidious, leading Anakin to betray the Jedi. In a moment of desperation and fear, Anakin turns to the dark side and becomes Darth Vader. Sidious issues Order 66, resulting in the massacre of the Jedi across the galaxy. Obi-Wan confronts Anakin on Mustafar in a heart-wrenching duel, defeating him but unable to save him. Padmé dies after giving birth to twins, Luke and Leia. The newborn Empire rises, replacing the Republic. Obi-Wan and Yoda go into hiding, and the galaxy falls under Sith rule. \'Revenge of the Sith\' is a story of downfall and loss. It explores ambition, fear, and the seduction of power. The film closes the tragic arc of Anakin Skywalker and sets the stage for the original trilogy. It remains the darkest entry in the saga, highlighting how good intentions can lead to catastrophic choices.','2014-12-20T18:49:38.403000Z','2014-12-20T20:47:52.073000Z');
